## C4 — Domain Flows (one-liners)

| Domain | Flow |
|---|---|
| **Create request** | Web form → API validates → build USDT transfer tx → store canonical payload → AWAITING_SIGNATURES |
| **Sign** | Web checkbox → signing token → local signer fetches payload → Ledger signs → API verifies ECDSA + getSignWeight |
| **Broadcast** | Executor confirms → API re-validates all gates → broadcasttransaction → poll confirmation → CONFIRMED |
| **Audit** | Every mutation → append AuditEvent with before/after state |
| **Config check** | Startup + admin save + pre-payment → read on-chain permissions → block if mismatch / unconfigured |

